WHAT YOU'LL GET
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  •  Free professional training in HubSpot CRM, Revenue Operations, and AI tools

  •  Industry certifications (HubSpot, Google, Salesforce)

  •  Career coaching, employer connections, and a Demo Day presentation

  •  Wraparound support based on your individual needs. This may assist with transportation, lunch and/or a loaner laptop if one is needed during the program. Let us know when you confirm your seat.

