TO CONFIRM YOUR SEAT
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Reply to this email with "I confirm" within 3 business days.

Seats are limited and held on a first-confirmed basis. If we don't hear from you by then, we may offer your seat to someone on the waitlist.

